  <div class="metric"><span class="metric-label">Open trades</span><span class="metric-value acc" id="mOpen">—</span><span class="metric-sub" id="mOpenProfit">—</span></div>
  <div class="metric"><span class="metric-label">Mejor Win %</span><span class="metric-value pos" id="mBestWR">—</span><span class="metric-sub" id="mBestName">—</span></div>
</div>

<div class="main">

  <div class="info-box">
    <strong>📡 Para conectar datos reales desde MT5:</strong> copia el archivo <code>RER_IncubadoraMonitor.mq5</code> a tu carpeta <code>MQL5/Experts/</code>, compílalo y arrástralo a un gráfico. Luego inicia <code>server.py</code> con Python (<code>python server.py</code>) y este dashboard se conectará automáticamente cada 10 segundos.<br>
    Mientras tanto estás viendo <strong>datos demo</strong> basados en tu historial real.
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-title">Top 15 sistemas</span>
    <span class="section-count" id="rankCount">—</span>
    <div class="controls">
      <button class="ctrl-btn active" onclick="setSort('default',this)">Ops + Win%</button>
      <button class="ctrl-btn" onclick="setSort('pf',this)">Profit Factor</button>
      <button class="ctrl-btn" onclick="setSort('profit',this)">Net Profit</button>
      <button class="ctrl-btn" onclick="setSort('winrate',this)">Win Rate</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead><tr>
        <th style="width:36px">#</th><th>Sistema</th>
        <th class="r">Ops</th><th class="r">Wins</th><th class="r">Losses</th>
        <th>Win %</th><th class="r">Loss %</th><th class="r">PF</th>
        <th class="r">Net Profit</th><th class="r">Abiertos</th>
        <th style="text-align:center">Criterios</th>
      </tr></thead>
      <tbody id="rankBody"></tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-title">Todos los sistemas</span>
    <span class="section-count" id="allCount">—</span>
  </div>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
